{"seq":3,"slug":"code-compliance-emergency-linkage","title":"规范合规校核、应急保障与消防联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/mep-building-services-systems-engineering/electrical-plumbing-fire-protection/code-compliance-emergency-linkage","wordCount":2962,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"规范合规校核-应急保障与消防联动\">规范合规校核、应急保障与消防联动</h1><p>一栋总建筑面积 12 万 m² 的商业综合体在消防验收时被退回，退回意见不是&quot;水泵扬程不足&quot;，而是&quot;首层中庭排烟风机由单个感烟探测器直接启动&quot;。水泵、风机、喷头全部合格，问题出在<strong>联动触发逻辑</strong>：GB 50116-2013《火灾自动报警系统设计规范》要求联动触发信号由两个独立报警触发装置以&quot;与&quot;逻辑组合，单个探测器只能报警、不能确认为火灾。这一条不是算术，却让整栋楼的联动调试重做。合规校核的难点从来不是&quot;会不会算&quot;，而是把散落的强制性条文<strong>编译成可执行、可留痕的断言</strong>，让设计输入、规范依据与验收证据在同一条链上闭合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-合规校核的三层证据链\">核心概念：合规校核的三层证据链</h2><p>MEP 设计的合规校核是一条<strong>闭环链</strong>，而不是设计结束前的一次性检查：条文匹配决定适用面，可计算断言决定通过与否，证据留痕决定能否被复核。三者缺一，验收阶段就会以&quot;无法追溯&quot;退回。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>输入 → 输出</th>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>条文匹配层</td>\n<td>建筑类别/高度/面积/用途 → 适用条文清单</td>\n<td>漏适用（如超高层漏 GB 55037 的避难层要求）→ 系统性缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可计算断言层</td>\n<td>条文 + 设计参数 → 通过/不通过</td>\n<td>阈值取错或量纲混乱 → 返工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据留痕层</td>\n<td>断言结果 → BIM 属性集/计算书/检测报告</td>\n<td>无留痕 → 审查/验收无法复核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层单向依赖：条文匹配错一次，后面两级再精确也救不回来。这也解释了为什么&quot;性能化设计&quot;必须走专家评审——它绕开条文匹配层，直接用断言层与证据层论证等效安全水平。整条链在工程全生命周期内循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[建筑与系统输入&lt;br/&gt;类别/高度/面积/用途] --&gt; B[条文匹配&lt;br/&gt;强制通用规范 + 专用标准]&#10;  B --&gt; C[可计算断言&lt;br/&gt;容量/压力/时序/照度]&#10;  C --&gt; D{校核}&#10;  D --&gt;|不通过| F[设计修改]&#10;  F --&gt; C&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| E[证据留痕&lt;br/&gt;BIM 属性集 + 计算书]&#10;  E --&gt; G[施工图审查 / 消防设计审查]&#10;  G --&gt; H[施工与系统调试]&#10;  H --&gt; I[消防设施检测 + 消防验收]&#10;  I --&gt; J[运维&lt;br/&gt;年度检测 + 数字化台账]&#10;  J --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[建筑与系统输入&lt;br/&gt;类别/高度/面积/用途] --&gt; B[条文匹配&lt;br/&gt;强制通用规范 + 专用标准]\n  B --&gt; C[可计算断言&lt;br/&gt;容量/压力/时序/照度]\n  C --&gt; D{校核}\n  D --&gt;|不通过| F[设计修改]\n  F --&gt; C\n  D --&gt;|通过| E[证据留痕&lt;br/&gt;BIM 属性集 + 计算书]\n  E --&gt; G[施工图审查 / 消防设计审查]\n  G --&gt; H[施工与系统调试]\n  H --&gt; I[消防设施检测 + 消防验收]\n  I --&gt; J[运维&lt;br/&gt;年度检测 + 数字化台账]\n  J --&gt; C</pre><p>这条链的关键位移发生在 2019 年：《消防法》修正后，建设工程消防设计审查验收职责从公安消防机构移交住房和城乡建设主管部门，《建设工程消防设计审查验收管理暂行规定》（住房和城乡建设部令第 51 号）确立了&quot;特殊工程消防设计审查 + 消防验收、其他工程备案抽查&quot;双轨制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范体系与强制条文的效力层级\">规范体系与强制条文的效力层级</h2><p>校核的第一动作是分清<strong>哪些条文是全文强制、哪些可以协商</strong>。中国自 2022 年起推行&quot;强制性工程建设规范&quot;体系：通用规范全文强制，每一条都必须严格执行，且<strong>与推荐性标准不一致时以通用规范为准</strong>——这改变了校核的优先级排序。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规范</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>覆盖对象</th>\n<th>校核要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GB 55037-2022 建筑防火通用规范</td>\n<td>全文强制，2023-06-01 施行</td>\n<td>建筑防火全专业底线</td>\n<td>防火分区、安全疏散、避难设施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB 55036-2022 消防设施通用规范</td>\n<td>全文强制，2023-06-01 施行</td>\n<td>各类消防设施</td>\n<td>设置范围、基本性能、联动要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB 55024-2022 建筑电气与智能化通用规范</td>\n<td>全文强制</td>\n<td>供配电、智能化</td>\n<td>消防电源、应急照明、接地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB 50016-2014(2018 年版) 建筑设计防火规范</td>\n<td>推荐性（含强制性条文）</td>\n<td>建筑防火</td>\n<td>与 GB 55037 交叉引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB 50116-2013 火灾自动报警系统设计规范</td>\n<td>推荐性</td>\n<td>报警与联动</td>\n<td>探测器布置、联动逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB 51309-2018 消防应急照明和疏散指示系统技术标准</td>\n<td>推荐性</td>\n<td>应急照明</td>\n<td>照度、持续时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB 50974-2014 消防给水及消火栓系统技术规范</td>\n<td>推荐性</td>\n<td>消防给水</td>\n<td>水量、水压、延续时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>海外项目另有体系：美国以 NFPA 72《国家火灾报警与信号规范》（三年一版，现行 2025 版）与 NFPA 101《生命安全规范》为核心，控制设备按 UL 864《火灾报警控制装置标准》认证；欧盟以 EN 54 系列（含 EN 54-13 系统兼容性）加建筑产品法规（CPR）为骨架，英国沿用 BS 5839-1。跨境项目常见的返工点是&quot;一套图纸两套逻辑&quot;——按 GB 50116 做的联动矩阵拿到按 NFPA 72 审查的项目上，会因分区、确认机制与告警分级差异被判不合格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消防联动的控制逻辑与时序\">消防联动的控制逻辑与时序</h2><p>联动的第一原则是**&quot;确认后才动作&quot;**。GB 50116-2013 规定：自动喷水灭火系统、气体灭火系统、防排烟系统等的联动触发信号，应采用两个独立报警触发装置报警信号的&quot;与&quot;逻辑组合，落地就是&quot;两个探测器&quot;或&quot;一个探测器加一个手动报警按钮&quot;。规则防止单点误报触发全楼动作，代价是允许一次确认延迟，因此探测器布置密度必须保证同一防护区内两点能先后可靠动作。</p>\n<p>联动一旦确认，控制器按预定义的<strong>时序矩阵</strong>下发指令。下图给出典型公共建筑从报警到动作的完整链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  DET[探测器 A 报警] --&gt; AND{与逻辑&lt;br/&gt;双信号确认}&#10;  DET2[探测器 B 或手动报警按钮] --&gt; AND&#10;  AND --&gt;|确认为火警| FACP[火灾报警控制器]&#10;  FACP --&gt; BROADCAST[消防应急广播&lt;br/&gt;分层分区播放]&#10;  FACP --&gt; LIGHT[应急照明 + 疏散指示&lt;br/&gt;应急启动 ≤5 s]&#10;  FACP --&gt; SMOKE[排烟风机启动&lt;br/&gt;+ 防火阀联动]&#10;  FACP --&gt; ELEV[消防电梯归底 + 普通电梯迫降]&#10;  FACP --&gt; PUMP[消防泵 / 喷淋泵启动]&#10;  FACP --&gt; POWER[消防电源末端切换&lt;br/&gt;≤30 s]&#10;  PUMP --&gt; FEED[压力开关 / 水流指示器&lt;br/&gt;反馈信号回传]&#10;  FEED --&gt; FACP\">flowchart TD\n  DET[探测器 A 报警] --&gt; AND{与逻辑&lt;br/&gt;双信号确认}\n  DET2[探测器 B 或手动报警按钮] --&gt; AND\n  AND --&gt;|确认为火警| FACP[火灾报警控制器]\n  FACP --&gt; BROADCAST[消防应急广播&lt;br/&gt;分层分区播放]\n  FACP --&gt; LIGHT[应急照明 + 疏散指示&lt;br/&gt;应急启动 ≤5 s]\n  FACP --&gt; SMOKE[排烟风机启动&lt;br/&gt;+ 防火阀联动]\n  FACP --&gt; ELEV[消防电梯归底 + 普通电梯迫降]\n  FACP --&gt; PUMP[消防泵 / 喷淋泵启动]\n  FACP --&gt; POWER[消防电源末端切换&lt;br/&gt;≤30 s]\n  PUMP --&gt; FEED[压力开关 / 水流指示器&lt;br/&gt;反馈信号回传]\n  FEED --&gt; FACP</pre><p>时序里有三个硬约束必须写进调试表：<strong>消防电源双回路末端自动切换时间通常要求 ≤ 30 s</strong>（GB 55024-2022 与 GB 50016-2014）；<strong>应急照明系统的应急启动时间不应大于 5 s</strong>（GB 51309-2018）；<strong>消防泵从接到启泵信号到正常出水的时间</strong>须在调试中实测确认。这三个数字横跨电气、照明、给水三个专业，任一专业单独算对而联动时序不闭合，验收都过不去。联动矩阵还要处理<strong>反馈</strong>：水泵启动后的压力开关、水流指示器信号须回传控制器，形成&quot;指令—动作—确认&quot;闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应急保障-电源-照明与疏散的定量底线\">应急保障：电源、照明与疏散的定量底线</h2><p>应急保障解决&quot;主电失电后系统还能不能工作&quot;的问题，校核全部落在可测量的时间与照度上，没有模糊空间。</p>\n<p><strong>消防电源</strong>按负荷等级配置：一级负荷由两个独立电源供电，特别重要负荷增设应急电源；消防用电设备须双回路供电并在<strong>末端配电箱自动切换</strong>。柴油发电机作应急电源时，容量须满足消防设备启动电流冲击，与变压器容量校核同源，参见 <a href=\"../mep-integration-load-model/load-validation-capacity-sizing\">负荷校验与容量确定</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>应急照明与疏散指示</strong>的定量要求由 GB 51309-2018 给出：疏散照明地面最低水平照度，一般场所不低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.0\\ \\mathrm{lx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">lx</span></span></span></span></span></span>，人员密集场所、避难层不低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.0\\ \\mathrm{lx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">lx</span></span></span></span></span></span>，楼梯间、前室与避难走道不低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5.0\\ \\mathrm{lx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">lx</span></span></span></span></span></span>；蓄电池电源持续工作时间，建筑高度大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\ \\mathrm{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的民用建筑不少于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，医疗建筑、老年人照料设施及总建筑面积大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100000</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100000\\ \\mathrm{m^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的公共建筑不少于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.0\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，其他建筑不少于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>疏散</strong>是应急保障的最终出口，疏散总净宽度按百人疏散指标与计算人数反算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = \\frac{N}{100}\\times b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为需要疏散的人数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为每百人疏散净宽度指标。它与防火分区最大允许面积、安全出口数量相互约束，任一项不满足都会在施工图审查阶段被退回。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规校核的可计算断言\">合规校核的可计算断言</h2><p>把上述条文编译成断言表，是合规校核落地的具体形式：每条断言写成带阈值的公式，并绑定到 BIM 属性集中的一个可查询字段。消防水系统的核心断言是<strong>消防水池有效容积</strong>，由各灭火系统的用水量与火灾延续时间叠加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.6</mn><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = 3.6 \\sum_i q_i\\, t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个系统设计流量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{L/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">L/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为对应火灾延续时间（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span>），系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.6</span></span></span></span></span> 完成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{L/s\\cdot h} \\to \\mathrm{m^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">L/s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的量纲换算。例如室内消火栓 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\ \\mathrm{L/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">L/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>、延续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，自动喷水按作用面积法确定流量、延续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.0\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，叠加再扣除延续时间内的可靠补水量，即为水池最小有效容积。<strong>延续时间取错是最常见的系统性偏差</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 误取为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.0\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，水池容积凭空放大 50%。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>断言</th>\n<th>公式 / 阈值</th>\n<th>适用规范</th>\n<th>失败含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消防电源切换</td>\n<td>双回路末端切换，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 30\\ \\mathrm{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>GB 55024-2022</td>\n<td>消防设备失电延误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应急照明启动</td>\n<td>应急启动时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 5\\ \\mathrm{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>GB 51309-2018</td>\n<td>疏散期间照明缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>疏散照明照度</td>\n<td>一般 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 1.0\\ \\mathrm{lx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">lx</span></span></span></span></span></span>；楼梯间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 5.0\\ \\mathrm{lx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">lx</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>GB 51309-2018</td>\n<td>疏散通道不可辨识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应急持续时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;100\\ \\mathrm{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 建筑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 1.5\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>GB 51309-2018</td>\n<td>长时间停电时照明耗尽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消防水池容积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.6</mn><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = 3.6\\sum q_i t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，扣除补水量</td>\n<td>GB 50974-2014</td>\n<td>持续灭火时间不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联动触发</td>\n<td>双独立信号&quot;与&quot;逻辑</td>\n<td>GB 50116-2013</td>\n<td>误报触发全楼动作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>疏散总净宽</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = \\frac{N}{100} b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>GB 55037-2022</td>\n<td>疏散瓶颈、拥堵</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把断言写进 IFC 属性集（<code>Pset_</code> 属性或项目自定义属性集），设计参数与校核结果就落在同一数据模型里，审查与运维可追溯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数字化审图与-2026-年的合规实践\">数字化审图与 2026 年的合规实践</h2><p>到 2026 年，合规校核正从&quot;人工比对条文&quot;向&quot;规则引擎自动校核&quot;迁移。住建部持续推进施工图数字化审查，深圳、广州、上海、北京等地在消防设计审查环节引入 BIM 报建与智能审查，把条文编译成机器可执行的规则集，对防火分区面积、安全出口距离、疏散宽度等几何量自动判违规；国际对标包括新加坡 CORENET e-submission 与北欧基于 Solibri 的规则校核，数据交换层普遍采用 <strong>IFC 4.3（ISO 16739-1:2024）</strong>。但规则引擎只擅长几何与数值断言：防火分区面积是否达标可自动判定，中庭烟气流动是否满足可用疏散时间（ASET &gt; RSET）仍需仿真与专家评审。</p>\n<p>运维侧的延伸是<strong>智慧消防</strong>：把消防设施运行状态（水泵压力、报警回路、应急照明蓄电池）接入城市消防远程监控系统（GB 50440），并按 GB 25201《建筑消防设施的维护管理》由第三方机构检测维保。设计阶段的断言在此变成可实时比对的阈值，合规转为全生命周期状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三层证据链</strong>——条文匹配决定适用面，可计算断言决定通过与否，证据留痕决定能否复核；条文匹配错一次，后面全错。</li>\n<li><strong>效力层级</strong>——GB 55037-2022、GB 55036-2022、GB 55024-2022 三条全文强制通用规范优先级最高，冲突时以通用规范为准。</li>\n<li><strong>联动&quot;确认后才动作&quot;</strong>——双独立信号&quot;与&quot;逻辑防止误报触发全楼，指令必须带反馈形成闭环。</li>\n<li><strong>应急保障落在时间与照度</strong>——电源切换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 30\\ \\mathrm{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、应急照明启动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 5\\ \\mathrm{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、持续时间按建筑高度分档。</li>\n<li><strong>断言可公式化</strong>——消防水池 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.6</mn><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = 3.6\\sum q_i t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span 